# Monad Feet - QA Findings

This directory is reserved for documented findings from the Monad Feet QA testing engagement.

## Current Status

The initial testing identified several observations and areas requiring further investigation. No software defect has been formally confirmed in the current report.

## Areas Requiring Investigation

- Like-state behaviour
- Comment-loading behaviour
- Top feed ranking clarity
- Post-creation requirements
- Post deletion and content permanence
- Differences between displayed on-chain and database post counts
- Subscription and exclusive-content flows

## Reporting Policy

Only findings supported by sufficient evidence and verified against the intended product requirements should be classified as confirmed bugs.

Observations and product improvement recommendations should remain separate from confirmed defects.

